&lt;/div&gt;</content><link href="https://news.hket.com/article/4146232/%E7%A7%BB%E6%B0%91%E5%BE%8C%E9%81%BA%EF%BD%9C%E7%A4%BE%E7%A6%8F%E6%A9%9F%E6%A7%8B%E7%AC%AC3%E5%B9%B4%E7%B5%B1%E8%A8%88%E8%AA%BF%E6%9F%A5%E7%95%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%95%B7%E8%80%85%E6%83%85%E6%B3%81%20%E3%80%80%E9%95%B7%E8%80%85%E3%80%8C%E9%9B%B6%E7%95%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%AD%90%E5%A5%B3%E3%80%8D%E6%AF%94%E4%BE%8B%E7%94%B13%E5%B9%B4%E5%89%8D%E7%9A%84%E5%85%A9%E6%88%90%E5%8D%8A%E5%A2%9E%E8%87%B35%E6%88%90?mtc=20023"/><published>2026-06-13T19:51:00+08:00</published></entry><entry><id>https://news.hket.com/article/4146198/%E5%A4%A9%E6%B0%A3%E9%A0%90%E5%A0%B1%EF%BD%9C%E5%A4%A9%E6%96%87%E5%8F%B0%EF%BC%9A%E6%9C%AA%E4%BE%86%E6%95%B8%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%AC%E6%B8%AF%E5%A4%A9%E6%B0%A3%E6%8C%81%E7%BA%8C%E4%B8%8D%E7%A9%A9%E5%AE%9A%E3%80%80%E9%A0%90%E6%96%99%E5%91%A8%E6%97%A5%E3%80%81%E5%91%A8%E4%B8%80%E7%B4%AF%E7%A9%8D%E9%9B%A8%E9%87%8F%E5%8F%AF%E9%81%94200%E6%AF%AB%E7%B1%B3?mtc=20023</id><title>天氣預報｜天文台：未來數日本港天氣持續不穩定　預料周日、周一累積雨量可達200毫米</title><updated>2026-06-13T20:21:00+08:00</updated><content type="html">

&lt;p&gt;Published on: 2026-06-13T20:21:05+08:00 Updated on: 2026-06-13T20:26:59.241+08:00&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="article-detail-content-container"&gt;
&lt;div class="non-paywall"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;天文台周六（13日）中午發出特別天氣提示，表示受活躍西南季候風及低壓槽影響，未來數日本港天氣持續不穩定。周日及星期一（6月14日及15日）部分地區雨勢特別大，預料兩日的累積雨量可達200毫米。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;span class="article-detail_inline-image block"&gt;
&lt;picture class="image-gallery-img"&gt;
&lt;source data-srcset="https://static04.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4145000/4146198/WhatsAppImage2026-06-08at1027181_1_1200_1200.jpeg" media="(min-width: 1200px)"/&gt;
&lt;source data-srcset="https://static04.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4145000/4146198/WhatsAppImage2026-06-08at1027181_1_1200_600.jpeg" media="(min-width: 992px)"/&gt;
&lt;source data-srcset="https://static04.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4145000/4146198/WhatsAppImage2026-06-08at1027181_1_1200_1024.jpeg" media="(min-width: 630px)"/&gt;
&lt;source data-srcset="https://static04.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4145000/4146198/WhatsAppImage2026-06-08at1027181_1_1200_600.jpeg" media="(min-width: 330px)"/&gt;
&lt;source data-srcset="https://static04.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4145000/4146198/WhatsAppImage2026-06-08at1027181_1_1200_300.jpeg" media="(min-width: 0px)"/&gt;
&lt;img alt="" class="lazyload" data-alt="天文台預計計未來數日本港天氣持續不穩定。(資料圖片)" data-link="" data-src="https://static04.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4145000/4146198/WhatsAppImage2026-06-08at1027181_1_1200_1200.jpeg" src="https://static04.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4145000/4146198/WhatsAppImage2026-06-08at1027181_1_1200_1200.jpeg" style="max-width:100%; height:auto;"/&gt;
