&lt;img alt="" class="lazyload" data-alt="Lucia指出，母親活力四射的原因在於她能夠從日常生活中找到真正的快樂。" data-link="" data-src="https://static04.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4140000/4144874/Screenshot2026-06-11151339_1_1200.png" src="https://static04.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4140000/4144874/Screenshot2026-06-11151339_1_1200.png" style="max-width:100%; height:auto;"/&gt;
